From: Gigachad Enthusiast <32457258-AreteMaxxing@users.noreply.gitlab.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:22:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] War log: W lines carry the declaring team's war plan

warLogWar logged the eWarPlan argument of CvTeam::declareWar, which most callers pass as
NO_WARPLAN, so every W line read -1. It now logs the argument when one is given, else the plan
the team holds toward the target as it declares. Logging only: on a 20-turn continuation of a
saved game the three AI declarations show WARPLAN_LIMITED and WARPLAN_TOTAL, and every other
war-log line is identical. Tools tests: 146 passed. Release build: 0 errors, 0 warnings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015smokgQ1KvKFbApTvkeH68
---
 Assets/CvGameCoreDLL/CvTeam.cpp | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Assets/CvGameCoreDLL/CvTeam.cpp b/Assets/CvGameCoreDLL/CvTeam.cpp
index e69aa33..853a593 100644
--- a/Assets/CvGameCoreDLL/CvTeam.cpp
+++ b/Assets/CvGameCoreDLL/CvTeam.cpp
@@ -1423,7 +1423,9 @@ void CvTeam::declareWar(TeamTypes eTeam, bool bNewDiplo, WarPlanTypes eWarPlan,
 
 	if (!isAtWar(eTeam))
 	{
-		warLogWar(getID(), eTeam, eWarPlan, false);
+		// War log: the plan passed in, else the plan this team holds toward eTeam as it declares (most
+		// callers pass NO_WARPLAN and leave the plan they prepared in place; it is set below).
+		warLogWar(getID(), eTeam, (eWarPlan != NO_WARPLAN) ? eWarPlan : AI_getWarPlan(eTeam), false);
 		//FAssertMsg((isHuman() || isMinorCiv() || GET_TEAM(eTeam).isMinorCiv() || isBarbarian() || GET_TEAM(eTeam).isBarbarian() || AI_isSneakAttackReady(eTeam) || (GET_TEAM(eTeam).getAtWarCount(true) > 0) || !(GC.getGameINLINE().isFinalInitialized()) || gDLL->GetWorldBuilderMode() || getVassalCount() > 0  || isAVassal() || GET_TEAM(eTeam).getVassalCount() > 0  || GET_TEAM(eTeam).isAVassal() || getDefensivePactCount() > 0), "Possibly accidental AI war!!!");
 
